# text_id = 1512
# text = If the right hon . Gentleman the Leader of the Opposition had taken action on any of these subjects he would have been acting in a way worthy of his position ; but after the explanations offered by the Leader of the House it is wholly unnecessary to take up the time of the House by this idle motion for adjournment .
