# text_id = 1550
# text = He suggested that the method adopted to avoid that danger should be made as simple as possible , and he considered that the end would be attained if it was made compulsory on the parties to an election to print the necessary warning against the offence of voting in two constituencies on the unofficial election cards sent out to all voters .
