# text_id = 1598
# text = I beg to ask the Secretary of State for India whether he will explain why Sir Charles Bernard 's recommendation not to reappoint a separate salaried President , to Cooper 's Hill College was not adopted ; and whether he can inform the House , if this recommendation had been adopted , what annual saving would have resulted therefrom since 1895 .
