# text_id = 1629
# text = If the Local Government Board would issue a statement to the authorities that were going to be responsible for the expenditure of public money during this winter telling them , not what they ought to do theoretically and hypothetically , but what other authorities had done successfully and what they had failed to do , it would be of great benefit .
