# text_id = 1630
# text = My noble friend says very truly that Parliament exists largely for the purpose of discussion , by which he means , and I mean , that the debates which take place in the House of Commons are essentially a part of our functions , and very greatly conduce to the sober and wise settlement of the various questions brought before it .
