# text_id = 1635
# text = In the present case it is perfectly certain that the rise in the price of corn necessarily followed from the imposition of the tax ; you cannot add a shilling in this way without raising the price of the commodity , and that applies to the corn grown in this country as well as to that imported from abroad .
