# text = I am sure every Member of the Committee , in whatever quarter of the House he may sit , shares my regret at the cause of the absence of the Chancellor of the Exchequer , who by the acknowledgment of all has in the Committee proceedings on this Bill exhibited , not only conspicuous ability , but unfailing temper .
