# text_id = 1655
# text = It is a commercial question , and one in which we should judge what is fair under all circumstances , and even if we have a prejudice against motor omnibuses we ought to consider whether a fine of this enormous amount ought to be imposed upon this particular company of £ 37,000 out of a total of £ 55,000 .
