# text_id = 1661
# text = The seconder of the Motion had spoken with enthusiasm and fervour in pleading for the Bill on grounds of humanity , but even if five - sixths of the Members of the House were to vote for the Second Reading to - day he would next year , if representing those who sent him , still oppose the measure .
