# text = This Bill was not a Bill to enable the State to do its duty to the Volunteers ; if the Volunteers did their duty to the State the State ought to do its duty to the Volunteers ; this was a Bill to allow the corporations and the Volunteers themselves to do what the State ought to do for them .
