# text_id = 1697
# text = There was no doubt that the only mandate before the electors at the last General Election was that of the alleged Chinese slavery in the Transvaal , and now after fourteen months the Under - Secretary for the Colonies had told them that during the month of January no fewer than 2,121 indentured Chinese labourers were introduced into the country .
