# text_id = 1721
# text = He began by telling us how highly satisfactory the conduct of the war has been , how splendid has been the progress which has been made ; and the manner in which he established that position was to show that in the year just concluded , we are spending more money than we have ever spent before , and we have more men in South Africa than we ever had before .
