# text_id = 1722
# text = His submission was that unless the county council had power to acquire land for a much longer period than thirty - five years , and if they had to expend public money on buildings and other works , they would not be able to demand from the tenant farmer an economic rent , and the rent he would have to pay would be so heavy as to make success impossible .
