# text = I am thankful to say we have got over that , and we have adapted ourselves , so far as the City and financial institutions are concerned , to that stamp , but we are considerably handicapped , not only in London , but in other cities in this country in competing for these very bonds which it is so necessary to our prosperity should be kept in this country .
