# text = These matters would really have to be dealt with by the Post Office officials , for they would never specially come before the Postmaster - General unless some serious objection was raised , and there was a very serious objection to granting to public officials the right to stop up and divert pipes , sewers , and drains connected with important and complicated sites , particularly in the City of London .
