# text_id = 1727
# text = It has absolutely no relevance , unless the right hon . Gentleman contemplates putting up such a tariff round this country , so high that it will prevent dumping and unfair competition , and secondly , that it will secure to our people in this country that stability which the foreign manufacturer is allowed to enjoy from the advantage of being able to over - produce at particular periods .
