# text_id = 1729
# text = The truth of the matter was that , although this body would have some judicial functions and ought to act in every matter in a judicial frame of mind , it was really an administrative more than a judicial body , and it would be a pity to limit the choice of members by saying the Government were not to have a free hand except within the terms of the Amendment .
