# text_id = 1731
# text = I beg to ask the Chief Secretary to the Lord Lieutenant of Ireland , in view of the interest taken all over Ireland in the question of re-afforesting , will he , with a view of promoting this object , advise the Department of Agriculture to supply young trees of different species to occupiers and owners of land in Ireland free of cost on condition that such trees are properly planted .
