# text_id = 1733
# text = I beg to ask Mr. Attorney General for Ireland whether he is aware that six tenants on the Annaly ( Rathcline ) Estate signed agreements to have their rents fixed by the Court Valuers , but the latter have not yet ( although these agreements were signed some months ago ) visited or inspected the holdings or given their decision ; and will he call for an explanation of such conduct .
