# text_id = 1736
# text = If an officer who has performed prodigies of valour , and is wounded , afterwards returns to the ranks , as many of them have done , and distinguishes himself in every way , if he is killed , and leaves to his unfortunate widow and family £ 500 , £ 100 , or no pounds at all , under this ingenious clause the family get nothing at all .
