# text = Therefore , to tell us that the expert should rule military controversies when they arise is not entirely to set at rest all the difficulties with which we are confronted ; and even if the wish of some Members were gratified by putting the decisions of the Commander - in - Chief above those of the Secretary of State you would really only have removed your difficulty by one stage .
