# text = He did not think these Rules would be good for the Ministers , because the interval for dinner would be like the meal they got at York when travelling North , which had to be devoured in twenty minutes , after which they generally spent the remainder of the journey struggling with the dyspepsia which followed from the hurried way in which they had flung the food into their stomachs .
