# text_id = 1743
# text = If there were some real question of importance underlying a rule or regulation any responsible Member of the Opposition , or any responsible Member commanding the adherence of any section of the House , would merely have to ask for a discussion on the subject , and it would be impossible for the Leader of the House to refuse an opportunity — at least , I have never known it done .
