# text_id = 1744
# text = As though to accentuate the responsibility of the Secretary of State for War , that Minister is empowered by Act of Parliament not only to appoint , but at his pleasure to remove , the Financial Secretary , who is his chief adviser on all questions of Army expenditure , responsible to him for the Army Estimates , and for the redistribution of the sums granted for the year .
