# text_id = 1745
# text = Apart from other economic considerations , if the hours of working in other coal fields were reduced from ten to eight , it would not introduce the smallest dislocation ; In every other part of Great Britain if an hour , or half an hour , were taken off the working hours of the men , it would not interfere with the smallest part of the arrangements of the mine .
