# text = If the right hon . Gentleman deducted the days which were to be devoted to Estimates , and Supplementary Estimates , the time to be given to the Irish Local Government Bill , the time he probably wished to give to the London Water Bill , and the time which must be given to the Appropriation Bill , how could he expect to be able to dispose of this Clause ?
