# text_id = 1747
# text = Of course , we cannot expect for a moment that men in the field would lay down their arms unless they were told that their lives would be safe , but they will want to know something more , and it will be absolutely futile to ask these men to lay down their arms unless you also say what is to happen to the country when they have done so .
