# text_id = 1751
# text = It had enormously diminished the control of Parliament over the Government , especially as , by the new rules , the Vote on Account could only be discussed for one day , and the humour of the thing was illustrated by the fact that the now rule was put forward by the Government as compensation to it for the enormous advantages given the House for the discussion of Supply .
