# text = He found that so far as regarded Walthamstow the actual figures were these , that according to the last Census there was a population of 95,131 , and that , applying that population and the density of that population to the area which the first Schedule specified , 190 licensed premises was the maximum to which this Bill at the end of fourteen years expected that area to come .
