# text = I think it is a pity that any school should receive less than any other school from public sources , for fear that by receiving less it may become less efficient than it otherwise would be ; but when I hear hon . Gentlemen opposite and particularly the Leader of the Opposition , talk about our having adopted this system of contracting out I am nearly filled with despair .
