# text_id = 1758
# text = We also appreciate the work done by individual chemists in small shops ; but the small employer who uses a qualified chemist for his own purposes is not , we think , a person who deserves any sympathy or support ; and it is the fact that it may very fairly be held that public safety is to some extent compromised by the existence of shops of that kind .
