# text = Apart from the bags for Dublin , direct bags are at present made up in the sea post offices between New York and Liver - pool for the Irish towns of Ballinasloe , Belfast , Castlerea , Claremorris , Clonmel , Cork , Dundalk , Galway , Kilkenny , Limerick , Lisburn , Londonderry , Lurgan , Mallow , Newry , Portadown , Sligo , Waterford , and Westport .
