# text_id = 1762
# text = I beg to ask the Secretary of State for War whether he is now able to state what reduction in rent , if any , he can grant to officers who are paying rent for bungalows in South Africa far in excess of their present value , rents calculated on the inflated prices charged when they were built , and which do not take into account their depreciation since that date .
