# text_id = 1764
# text = To my mind one of the greatest drawbacks of our present system is that which is to be found in the fact that of the men who do enter the Army so large a number waste away and disappear in the first years of their service , giving us neither the full period of their service with the colours nor the advantage of their presence afterwards in the Reserve .
