# text_id = 1766
# text = In London , in the boroughs of long standing , there is a great deal of local patriotism , and blending them into one vast whole is certainly not likely to be conducive to that local life which was set up , not by the establishment of the London County Council , but by the formation of the borough councils with separate constitutions and all the appanage of separate constitution .
