# text_id = 1768
# text = I beg to ask the Chief Secretary to the Lord Lieutenant of Ireland if it is intended to send members of the Dublin Metropolitan Police to Hythe to undergo a course of musketry drill ; and , if so , is there any intention to arm the force with rifles ; and , if not , will he state what is the object of having them trained in musketry drill .
