# text = Of course , if it is simply an argument to say , " Let us put the Liberals out and put the Tories in , " it is an argument for that , but it cannot be an argument against Home Rule , and that is part of our case against the Union — that you have these periods of disorder and you have them for a clearly assignable reason .
