# text = I have had the honour myself of adjudicating in some of these cases , and we valued the ability to say to the applicants with these old beerhouses in a congested district , and some of them not needed , and to lay down as a condition to granting a new licence where an on-licence is needed , that the applicant should surrender one or more of those old licences .
