# text_id = 1773
# text = They absolutely justify themselves as contributions to the revenue of the present year , and they justify themselves still more , as the Chancellor of the Exchequer has said , as trees which will grow in strength and productiveness in the years to come , and which will help you to meet the growing expenditure of those years , which , unfortunately , we are I obliged to anticipate .
