# text = I do not suppose my Hon , friend desires to go to a division on the suggestion , or to prolong the discussion ; but if the First Lord of the Treasury would give a serious promise that he will go into the matter with a view of meeting this demand , I am sure it would meet with the almost universal approval of the Members of the House .
