# text_id = 1776
# text = If it were possible to tax all the incomes of the country — he was not going to argue that it was possible — the result would be that either the Chancellor of the Exchequer instead of getting £ 30,000,000 from the tax would get his £ 90,000.000 , or he could reduce the rate of the tax from 1s. to 4d . and still get his £ 30,000,000 .
