# text_id = 1777
# text = I presented to your Lordships to - night 475 petitions from different parishes , with 60,298 signatures , and , if any one of your Lordships will examine them , he will be struck , I am certain , by the kind of persons who sign them and by the contrast they present to petitions sometimes presented to both Houses of Parliament , got up by societies for partisan purposes .
