# text = To ask the Under - Secretary of State for the Colonies whether he will consider the desirability of preventing the importation into South Africa of such of the 16,199 coolies whose licences were signed between the 12th and 18th of November last , but who have not yet arrived in South Africa , and prevent the expenditure of £ 17 10s . per head , the estimated cost of repatriation .
