# text = Here was the case of a vessel that was peculiarly liable to have to undergo many at least minor alterations and modifications , for the reason that the vessel was to fulfil the requirements of her late gracious Majesty , and it was not to be expected that either her late Majesty or his present Majesty could settle everything designed for their dignified use or entirely grasp drawings and specifications .
