# text_id = 1782
# text = The Liberal Partial ways stood to its cause ; and , apart from any other reason for doing so , there was this — that we have long since recognised in the Party opposite a certain plastic and elastic character of principle , and a certain adaptability of policy , which always leaves us the hope that they may themselves be found on the same side of a question as ourselves .
