# text = I beg to ask the Chief Secretary to the Lord Lieutenant of Ireland with reference to the contributory poor law unions , whether the refund from the excise and customs duties is about to cease ; and , if so , whether an equal grant will be made from some other source to those unions that decide to remain contributory , and to the others that may become contributory .
