# text_id = 1785
# text = Therefore , to - day we find an extensive system of marine insurance , which , though based on no legal sanction , which , though enforced by no statutory authority , nevertheless enables the insuring persons to gather any advantages which may accrue to them from their policies with a regularity and a practical certainty indistinguishable from that certainty afforded by the operation of the law of the land .
