# text_id = 1786
# text = According to the intention of the Government every public - house in the country is to be valued upon the basis of the compensation which it would receive if it were reduced for compensation , and that would apply not only to England and Wales , where the Compensation Act is in force , but also in Scotland and Ireland , in which that Act has never had any application .
