# text_id = 1789
# text = The reason of that I take to be this — and lit is a fact which must prevent us , as it seems to me , from ever deriving any great advantage from retaliatory duties — that in the minds of foreign Powers whose avowed policy is protection it is a matter of much less importance to lower duties against themselves than to foster their own manufactures at home .
