# text = I quite admit that a good part of the information which I ask for on the subject of the Returns relating to our foreign trade are to be found in the publications of the Board of Trade , and most of us — at all events , those who pay much attention to the subject — are perfectly aware of the most salient points which are contained in those Returns .
