# text_id = 1791
# text = Where I differ from him is in thinking that , unless some such Amendment is carried , the objects that he and I have in view cannot be carried out , and it seems to me that these words which it is proposed to omit give , and are intended to give , to the Commissioners absolute discretion as to whether they shall or shall not admit these deductions .
