# text_id = 1792
# text = After all , it does not matter so very much whether you pass an Act one session or the next , but once let this House lose its hold upon the affections and loyalty of the people , once let it be thought that we cannot carry out the great functions committed to our charge , I for one should be inclined to despair of the future of the British Empire .
