# text = If that is true , if the cup has been full all this time , is it not a more just and honourable way of proceeding to approach this subject upon the basis of historical facts calmly reviewed and judicially dealt with , rather than to import all the prejudice which you are importing into it week after week and month after month in your constantly - repeated speeches ?
