# text_id = 1795
# text = But , taking the figures for the Transvaal and Orange River camps , the camps really in question , I find that the death rate of children in these camps in October last was 601 per annum per 1,000 ; in November it was 499 ; in December , 388 ; and in January , which month we are told marked such splendid results , it is still 262 per 1,000 .
