# text_id = 1798
# text = He is a Member of the Distinguished Service Order , and has passed through the Staff College ; but what I object to , and what every Cavalry officer I have come across during the last fortnight or three weeks resents , is the promotion of an Infantry captain over the heads of highly - trained and efficient cavalry soldiers who have proved their quality by prolonged service in the field .
