# text_id = 1804
# text = I have heard several speeches bringing forward the various industries , such as the iron industry , the shipping industry , the gas industry , and other industries which depend more or less upon coal , and what I should like to hear from the Government to - night is how they propose to convince those various industries that they will not be damaged if the price of coal is increased .
