# text_id = 1809
# text = My hon . Friend has pointed out that the tenant under the Act of 1904 is now paying , I should think , about £ 7 or £ 10 , according to what the licensing justices may fix the figure at , but , if he has an extra £ 10 to pay the landlord has to contribute towards that , according to the scale my hon . Friend has cited .
