# text_id = 1811
# text = Those of your Lordships who are familiar with the facts in the northern towns of England — and perhaps in some southern towns — know that , whether it was due to the municipal rivalry to which the noble Viscount referred or to some other cause , there is place after place where the school boards have overbuilt themselves , and where there is now abundant vacant space in their schools .
