# text_id = 1816
# text = In some of the closing parts of it the sympathy the right hon . Gentleman expressed for the great and serious problem with which we are faced we can all admire ; but what disappointed me with the speech was that it contained no suggestion as to how the relief which the Government say they are providing by way of grants is going to be spread over a wide range .
