# text = Well , he put no limits to what might be urged by counsel in various cases ; but no tribunal of any description , in reading Clause 8 as his right hon . and learned friend proposed to amend it , would for a moment suggest that the whole area of misconduct was exhausted by it , or was intended by the Government or the House to be exhausted by it .
