# text_id = 1819
# text = I do not think the bona fide traveller trouble is increasing with us ; still it does exist to some extent , and I feel sure that the magistrates and the police , as well as the inhabitants generally of my constituency , will welcome an amendment of the law with reference to it , and which will make evasion of the law more difficult than it is at present .
