# text_id = 1820
# text = It is now nearly a century since the House laid down the principle that it would not sanction an Enclosure Act without good reason , and it laid down a code to which every Bill of this character should conform ; and for the last twenty years no promoter has had the audacity to present a Bill to this House without making it conform to the code laid down in 1876 .
