# text_id = 1823
# text = The Prime Minister has stated that he has not been able so far to form any conviction on this subject ; but we have always been used to look to the noble Duke for a very candid judgment on any broad political issue , and I can hardly think he will consent to leave this House and the country in general in doubt as to his views on this subject .
