# text = In the House of Lords there were a large number of legal gentlemen who were particularly qualified to deal with the matters connected with the Bill , and he sincerely hoped that the House of Lords , would show it was a useful body , by dealing with the Bill in a very different manner to that in which it had been dealt with in the House of Commons .
