# text_id = 1825
# text = I think this makes the fourth subject which we have had recently on which the Government have no settled convictions — there is the question of fiscal reform , there is the question of reform of the War Office , there is the Irish Catholic University question , and now there is the basis of a concordat to settle this much disputed question of religious teaching in voluntary schools .
