# text = He had been advised by a noble and learned friend who was more skilled than himself in the strange and mysterious language of Acts of Parliament that it would be prudent to insert after the word " possesses " the words " for any reason , " so that it would read " or which possesses for any reason an exceptional or accommodation value , " and so on .
