# text_id = 1827
# text = I am not in any way interested in landlords , but I do say that I think it is only fair to show that some of these great evils which exist are due to the causes I have mentioned , and I believe the very best way to promote the erection of a large number of small houses for the poor would be by encouraging private enterprise to provide them .
