# text_id = 1830
# text = I beg to ask the President of the Local Government Board whether he can give the House the results of the trials of the Mile End Guardians , and the total results of the inquiries he instituted ; and whether , in view of the scandals existing under the present system which he has brought to light , the Government will consider the propriety of restoring the ex-officio guardians .
