# text_id = 1831
# text = Under an arrangement come to in the purchase agreement of 1905 , considerable systems of underground wires have been , and are being , constructed by the Post Office and leased I to the Company on rental terms until 1911 , so as to facilitate the due extension of the telephone system , while at the same time making provision by new construction to meet the public requirements after 1911 .
