# text_id = 1836
# text = I have been in the House in the old days , when we sat till very late hours , though never , I think , when hours so late as this became the habitual practice of the House , but that was on Bills simple in their character , however contentious , in which there were not new , difficult , and complex questions raised by each clause and each Amendment .
