# text = However , he would convey the objection of the hon . Gentleman to the Lord Advocate to employing an official of the Government in collecting information as to land valuations , but personally he did not think that he would be able to persuade Members for Scotland to accept a proposal that surveyors of taxes should not be allowed to act as assessors when required to do so in special circumstances .
