# text_id = 1848
# text = It is perfectly true that the Prime Minister holds , and has expressed , opinions on various subjects , such , for instance , as female suffrage , bimetallism , and Catholic education in Ireland , which are not those of the whole of his Party , but although the Prime Minister may have stated his opinion on these questions he has never made them the subject of propaganda .
