# text = They should be able to show the House that the Government were doing absolutely a new thing , the most unwarrantable thing in the whole history of Ireland , in imposing such a tyranny on a country which was without any crime or bloodshed , and on a question in which the Chief Secretary himself confessed that the Irish Members were in the right and their opponents in the wrong .
