# text = But there is another plan much better than that proposed by the Government , and that is to endeavour , if we can , to secure to these States something like the freedom enjoyed in Canada and Australia , subject to the general supremacy of Great Britain , subject to the British flag , and to complete control by British officers in all matters in which contro is necessary .
