# text = From that source of friction they hoped to be free ; and reviewing the progress of education in Scotland , they might feel that with regard to the progress made in the past , both before and after the Act of 1872 , it was an indication that there were two lines on which they should proceed if they wanted to keep the education of the country abreast with the times .
