# text = He will find himself probably with from £ 500 to £ 1,000 worth of stock in liquors , without the power of selling a single bottle ; and he will find himself , while saddled with this unrealisable stock on the one hand , met on the other with the obligation of paying for probably three - fourths of it to the merchants from whom he has purchased it on credit .
