# text_id = 1855
# text = I have no special information as to the details of the accommodation provided at this hospital , but I am confident that the matter may safely be left to the discretion of the Government of India , who , aided by their professional advisers , are always anxious to make the best arrangements that are practicable for the treatment of soldiers who are on the sick list or in hospital .
