# text = The Board of Education and the Board of Agriculture have arranged general lines of direct co-operation in relation to the educational work carried on for rural areas , and in particular with a view to the improvement and extension of specialised instruction in all grades bearing on agriculture , and the maintenance of a close relation between such instruction and the practice and progress of the various sections of the industry .
