# text = A large part of the trade in the Port of London will be conducted under conditions entirely different from those under which the rest is conducted , and it is obvious that what may be a good system on the Clyde or the Mersey may turn out to be a very bad system so far as the Port of London is concerned , and here again we have different experiences .
