# text_id = 1860
# text = We are aware that a Royal Commission is sitting at the present moment on the question of the Auxiliary Forces , and that it will presumably report during this session ; but , whatever their Report may be , I conclude that Volunteer camps will be held this year as usual , and that it will be necessary for at least 50 per cent , of the Volunteers to attend .
