# text_id = 1861
# text = The noble Marquess is no doubt conscious — we are all conscious — of the importance of maintaining the authority and the prestige of the Viceroy in the face of our Indian fellow - subjects ; but if it is important to maintain the prestige of the Viceroy of India it is equally important , perhaps oven more urgent , to maintain the prestige of commanding officers in the field .
