# text_id = 1863
# text = Although the Bill I introduced is somewhat on the same lines as that of the Government Bill which we are now considering , I would suggest that the members of the Water Board shall remain on that Board so long as they are the representatives of the Local Constituent Authorities , and until they are replaced by some other representatives , so long shall they remain members of the Water Board .
