# text_id = 1869
# text = It has not been stated , I think , that those who promised to underwrite the £ 10,000,000 would not do so unless the interest was 4 per cent . , the consequence of which is that they may be making an extremely good thing by lending at 4 per cent . , for besides the liability of the Transvaal they also have behind them the liability of this country .
