# text = Eighteen years afterwards a stranger to the district marches in and states that this is a contravention of the unwritten code , and this man , who lent £ 400 and spent £ 900 of his own money , is suddenly subjected to ostracism and every form of petty and even of grave annoyance , and that is done against the repeated protest of the Catholic priest in the place .
