# text = I beg to ask the hon . Member for South Somerset , as representing the President of the Board of Agriculture , if he can state if free importation of live cattle is allowed into Canada from the United States or elsewhere ; if any quarantine regulations are existent in Canada , and their nature ; and how the line is preserved over the 3,000 odd miles of frontier .
