# text = But Privy Councillors like the right hon . and gallant Member for North Armagh put themselves at the head of these armed bands , and by appealing to the Bible and to " the Sword of the Lord and of Gideon , " and all these considerations , on the date of these anniversaries , worked up these unhappy people in order to assail by vituperation and assault their fellow citizens .
