# text_id = 1882
# text = To ask the Chief Secretary to the Lord - Lieutenant of Ireland whether , in view of the scarcity of turf in certain school areas in Ireland , and the distance many children have to walk over mountainous roads in inclement weather to attend school in the winter season , he will place on the Estimates a sum of £ 24,000 to provide fires in all Irish national schools .
