# text_id = 1883
# text = Now that the Government have assented to the Second Reading of the Bill , I only desire to point to a very happy feature in the present debate — namely , that there has been no attack on religious institutions or their working , and no tendency , on the other hand , to resist the Bill on the ground that harm would be done by it to such institutions .
