# text_id = 1885
# text = This was the first time any mention was made of that Board though it was constituted in 1831 , when the first Act was passed , but now the Board of Works came in and unfortunately they would find that all through the history of these attempts to drain the great rivers of Ireland the Board of Works had interfered , with almost disastrous effects , in nearly every case .
