# text_id = 1886
# text = If the owner takes a piece of land of 10 acres , of which some part is likely to come into building value , he apportions it in accordance with what his views are as to the parts which will come into building value , and he will put his valuation where it will be of most use to him , and where he thinks the value is going to accrue .
