# text = I beg to ask the Postmaster - General whether for the collection of mail bag by private messenger the charge is usually £ 1 1s . per annum ; whether some people got special and better terms ; and , if not , will he state what is the fixed practice of the Department in these matters , and amend the Post Office Guide , page 46 , accordingly .
