# text_id = 1888
# text = In the first place , he must know that , however valuable a discussion of this kind would be in informing public opinion , it would be quite impossible this year , however able a presentation of arguments be made to them , and however conclusive those arguments might be as to the general impropriety or disadvantage attaching to the tax , to reconstruct the present Budget to meet his views .
