# text = I beg to ask Mr. Chancellor of the Exchequer if he will grant a Return showing the output of pot-still spirit in Scotland and Ireland , respectively , during the last financial year and for the six months ended 30th September last ; and the output in gallons of patent - still spirit in England , Scotland , and Ireland , respectively , for the same periods above mentioned .
