# text = It must be quite evident to the House that , whatever may be said against the present system , or in favour of a new Under Secretary for the Post Office , or for the Postmaster General having a seat in the House of Commons , nothing can be said for the plan which my right hon . friend suggests , and which has never been heard of before .
