# text = I ask if the gravamen of the charge that is laid against me can be sustained ; I ask if I have not met the Leader of the Opposition on every single point ; and I ask the Committee to say that there is not only a good deal to be said on this side , but that the enormous weight of experience and fact lies on this side .
