# text = I beg to ask the President of the Board of Education if the Education ( Local Authority Default ) Act , 1904 , is now being enforced in any county in Wales or Monmouthshire ; and , if not , whether all the local education authorities concerned are now fulfilling the financial † See ( 4 ) Debates , clxxii. , 772 obligations imposed on them by the Act of 1902 .
