# text_id = 1907
# text = As was very truly said by a critic of the proposal , Senator demons , the Ministry was trying to translate into law the cry of preferential trade , but the Bill which was introduced dealt with not more than one - twelfth of the total trade between England and Australia , and in no single case did it propose to lower the tariff in favour of Great Britain .
