# text_id = 1914
# text = After a great deal of agitation upon the subject an inquiry was instituted by the Government of the day , and the result was that the clerical peer was made to disgorge a great part of the funds he had been appropriating for years , and he was dismissed from his office , although he was not prosecuted , as he should have been , for the frauds he had committed .
