# text_id = 1917
# text = As this general Resolution is one which was the least cussed on the night when the Chancellor of the Exchequer introduced his financial statement , and as such discussion as there was was confined to a few Members from Ireland below the Gangway , whose patriotism enabled them on the spur of the moment to devise a means of raising discussion , I desire now to say a few .
