# text_id = 1919
# text = To ask the Chief Secretary to the Lord Lieutenant of Ireland , how many policemen are stationed in the town of Gort ; how many of them are classified as extra police , and will any portion of the cost be charged to the local rates ; and , having regard to the peaceful state of the town , will he consider the advisability of withdrawing the extra force .
