# text_id = 1920
# text = I must confess that from my point of view I believe the Defence Committee are absolutely right in the new conclusion , in so far as it is new , at which they have arrived , and if any statement I have made in earlier years requires qualification in the sense of the statement I have just made , I hope everybody who reads my former speeches will make that qualification .
