# text_id = 1924
# text = I beg to ask the Chief Secretary to the Lord - Lieutenant of Ireland if he will say how many evicted tenants have been reinstated in West Cavan ; how many are in process of being restored to their old holdings ; have the Estates Commissioners purchased any untenanted land , or are they negotiating for same ; and , if so , will he give the approximate figures .
