# text_id = 1933
# text = If the right hon . Gentleman took that view , he was not sure that he would not agree with him ; but if we were to apply the principle of expropriation in the Transvaal , why not here , where there were large numbers of people " who toiled not , neither did they spin , " and crofters whose land was given over to a few wretched stags .
