# text_id = 1934
# text = I do not think it will be contended that the land - grabber in Ireland , who is what the blackleg is in this country , has suffered in life or in limb ; or has suffered any greater pain of mind from public opinion than any non-unionist workman in England has to make up his mind to if he has determined to exercise his own selfish right unfairly .
