# text_id = 1935
# text = In one case it was stated that one shilling per cent . only had been charged , and when an unfortunate accident happened , and the insurance company was called upon to pay , they disputed the matter at every turn , and caused a great deal of irritation and annoyance , which , if they had first of all charged a reasonable premium , might have been avoided .
